{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "暂停之后",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 68.04,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2026 年 10 月 29 日，Binance 的热钱包，开始大额转出。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 10 月 29 日，Binance 的热钱包，开始大额转出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 6.773
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "先是 XRP，再是比特币，然后是以太坊。",
   "spoken": "先是 XRP，再是比特币，然后是以太坊。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 7.18,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 7.18,
   "speechEnd": 11.844
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "一条链接着一条链，资产往外流。",
   "spoken": "一条链接着一条链，资产往外流。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 12.28,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 12.374,
   "speechEnd": 15.43
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "交易所发现之后，暂停了提现。",
   "spoken": "交易所发现之后，暂停了提现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 15.86,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 15.86,
   "speechEnd": 17.951
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "可按项目方的初步报告，暂停提现，没有挡住全部的未授权转账。",
   "spoken": "可按项目方的初步报告，暂停提现，没有挡住全部的未授权转账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 18.4,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 18.4,
   "speechEnd": 24.105
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "最后一笔，到世界协调时 23 点 56 分，才转完。",
   "spoken": "最后一笔，到世界协条时 23 点 56 分，才转完。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 24.54,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 24.634,
   "speechEnd": 29.56
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "项目方的口径是，约 63.4 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "项目方的口径是，约 63.4 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 30.04,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 30.04,
   "speechEnd": 34.893
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "这是有记录以来，最大的一起加密资产盗窃案。",
   "spoken": "这是有记录以来，最大的一起加密资产盗窃案。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 35.3,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 35.394,
   "speechEnd": 39.125
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "更反常的是，Binance 称，没有发现私钥泄露的证据。",
   "spoken": "更反常的是，Binance 称，没有发现私钥泄露的证据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 39.6,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 39.698,
   "speechEnd": 43.779
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "没有私钥，钱是怎么签出去的？",
   "spoken": "没有私钥，钱是怎么签出去的？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 44.22,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 44.316,
   "speechEnd": 46.894
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 47.6,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 47.6,
   "speechEnd": 48.43
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "提现已经暂停，热钱包服务也关掉了。",
   "spoken": "提现已经暂停，热钱包服务也关掉了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 48.86,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 48.86,
   "speechEnd": 52.128
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "以太坊热钱包上，还留着一个恶意的 EIP-7702 委托。",
   "spoken": "以太坊热钱包上，还留着一个恶意的 EIP-7702 委托。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-12.wav",
   "start": 52.52,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 52.617,
   "speechEnd": 58.1
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-13",
   "text": "这时候，新转进这个地址的钱，安全吗？",
   "spoken": "这时候，新转进这个地址的钱，安全吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-13.wav",
   "start": 58.58,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 58.58,
   "speechEnd": 61.987
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-14",
   "text": "带着这个问题，我们看看交易所的两张面孔。",
   "spoken": "带着这个问题，我们看看交易所的两张面孔。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-14.wav",
